# Claude Code specific.
#
# `.claude/` carries three kinds of content with different visibility needs:
#   - skills/ and agents/ are intentional, reviewed orchestration assets that
#     are useful for anyone reading the repo — keep them tracked + public.
#   - PHASES.md and README.md document the pipeline design itself — public.
#   - worktrees/ is ephemeral per-run state (auto-cleaned by the agent
#     harness when a run produces no changes); it should never be tracked.
#
# The pattern below ignores everything under .claude/ EXCEPT the four
# things above. New additions to .claude/ default to private — bless them
# explicitly with `!.claude/<name>` if they should be public.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/PHASES.md
!.claude/README.md
.claude/worktrees/

.tasks/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# npm pack rehearsal artifacts
apiwright-*.tgz
